OL,3,GNEWSAUK falls silent to mark Armistice
OL,4,ADay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Staffordshire, the Duke and Duchess
OL,7,Fof Gloucester also laid a wreath during
OL,8,Fthe service at the Royal British Legion
OL,9,FNational Remembrance Gardens.
